sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as Client / CLI (kip compact)
    participant DB as DB Coordinator (db.go)
    participant Index as Active Index (index.go)
    participant Compactor as Compactor (compaction.go)
    participant TmpFile as Staging File (<path>.compact.tmp)
    participant OrigFile as Authoritative File (<path>)
    participant OS as OS Filesystem

    Caller->>DB: Compact()
    Note over DB: Acquire exclusive lock (db.mu.Lock)
    DB->>Compactor: compactLocked()

    Note over Compactor,Index: Step 1: Snapshot Live Keys
    Compactor->>Index: Snapshot()
    Index-->>Compactor: liveEntries (sorted snapshot of live keys only)

    Note over Compactor,TmpFile: Step 2: Initialize Replacement File
    Compactor->>OS: Remove(<path>.compact.tmp) (clean stray temp)
    Compactor->>OS: OpenFile(<path>.compact.tmp, O_CREATE|O_RDWR|O_EXCL)
    Compactor->>TmpFile: WriteAtFull(FileHeader, offset=0)

    Note over Compactor,TmpFile: Step 3: Stream Live Batches (Dual-Bounded)
    loop While live keys remain
        Note over Compactor: Chunk bounded by: <= 1000 ops AND <= 16 MiB payload
        Compactor->>OrigFile: Read live values at current file offsets
        Compactor->>Compactor: Assemble TxnHeader, Payload, CommitFooter, Dual CRCs
        Compactor->>TmpFile: WriteAtFull(chunkTxnBytes, offset=newCommittedEnd)
        Compactor->>Compactor: Track new offsets in staged newIndex
    end

    Note over Compactor,TmpFile: Step 4: Durable Flush
    Compactor->>TmpFile: SyncFile() (fsync to disk)
    alt Sync Failure
        Compactor->>OS: Remove(<path>.compact.tmp)
        Compactor-->>DB: return sync error (original untouched)
    end

    Note over Compactor,OrigFile: Step 5: Close Active Descriptors (Windows Compatibility)
    Compactor->>OrigFile: Close()
    Compactor->>TmpFile: Close()

    Note over Compactor,OS: Step 6: Atomic File Swap
    Compactor->>OS: os.Rename(<path>.compact.tmp, <path>)
    alt Rename Fails
        Compactor->>OS: Reopen original (<path>)
        Compactor->>OS: Remove(<path>.compact.tmp)
        Compactor-->>DB: return rollback error (original restored)
    end

    Note over Compactor,OrigFile: Step 7: Reopen Authoritative File & Publish
    Compactor->>OS: OpenFile(<path>, O_RDWR)
    Compactor->>Index: ReplaceWith(newIndex)
    Note over DB: db.file = newFile<br/>db.committedEnd = newCommittedEnd<br/>db.nextTxID = nextTxID<br/>db.compactionCount++

    Compactor-->>DB: return nil (Success)
    DB-->>Caller: return nil
    Note over Caller: Dead space reclaimed, 100% live keys preserved
